        "file": "0001-distribute-via-github-releases.md",
        "title": "Distribute via CI-built artifacts on the GitHub Releases page",
        "description": "Distribution machinery must match the audience that exists today",
        "status": "accepted",
        "tags": "distribution, release, ci"
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "id": "ADR-0002",
        "label": "0002",
        "parent": "group-macos",
        "colour": "#7c3aed",
        "file": "0002-purego-bridge-cgo-free.md",
        "title": "Bridge to macOS through purego with CGO_ENABLED=0",
        "description": "Bind OS primitives through purego, CGO off; prove each symbol on real hardware first",
        "status": "accepted",
        "tags": "macos, ffi, build"
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "id": "ADR-0003",
        "label": "0003",
        "parent": "group-accessibility",
        "colour": "#6366f1",
        "file": "0003-fail-loudly-without-grant.md",
        "title": "Fail loudly when Accessibility is not granted",
        "description": "Fail with the responsible party named; never report an empty world as success",
        "status": "accepted",
        "tags": "accessibility, errors"
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "id": "ADR-0004",
        "label": "0004",
        "parent": "group-testing",
        "colour": "#6366f1",
        "file": "0004-two-test-tiers.md",
        "title": "Two test tiers; the integration tier fails, never skips",
        "description": "Pure coverage universal; the real seam tested on real hardware; a skip is a green lie",
        "status": "accepted",
        "tags": "testing, coverage"
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "id": "ADR-0005",
        "label": "0005",
        "parent": "group-discovery",
        "colour": "#d97706",
        "file": "0005-group-windows-by-bundle-id.md",
        "title": "Group windows by bundle id, not PID",
        "description": "Group by product identity (bundle id), never process identity",
        "status": "accepted",
        "tags": "discovery, identity"
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "id": "ADR-0006",
        "label": "0006",
        "parent": "group-discovery",
        "colour": "#d97706",
        "file": "0006-report-unactionable-windows.md",
        "title": "Report windows the tool cannot act on instead of hiding them",
        "description": "Never hide what the tool cannot act on; incomplete enumeration fails the run",
        "status": "accepted",
        "tags": "discovery, errors"
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "id": "ADR-0007",
        "label": "0007",
        "parent": "group-discovery",
        "colour": "#d97706",
        "file": "0007-display-index-y-then-minx.md",
        "title": "Order display indexes by row, then left to right",
        "description": "Indexes follow the known ordering; stable identity is UUID or name",
        "status": "accepted",
        "tags": "discovery, displays, ordering"
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
